    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk. i dont know if i want to be 'in the stillness' anymore. it just feels heavy. like i'm just taking up space that doesn't belong to me. like i'm just a ghost that hasn't realized it's dead yet. does it ever feel like there's just no point in trying to make a dent?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
