    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what does that even mean? \"letting go\"? it sounds like you're saying it's okay to just... stop. like, if i'm just a ghost, then maybe it wouldn't even be a struggle to just fade away. it feels like there's no harm in it, you know? because nobody would even notice the difference in a place like this.",
